{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe Töplitz basin, some three hours wide, stretched out before me today from the Schloßberg, a vast amphitheater between the Saxon and Bohemian ranges. Kulm and Marienschein sat quietly on the horizon, with Aussig far off on the Elbe. The air is sharp here, cutting away the Berlin damp.\n\nI strolled the town and, after a modest dinner of roast duck and local wine, attended a performance of *Preciosa*. The acting was wooden, the costumes threadbare; I paid two florins for the privilege of watching talent struggle against its own limitations. I found the audience, however, far more interesting than the stage, their faces reflecting a local pride that seems well-founded in their geography.\n\nKarl’s last letter mentioned the autumn leaves; I see no such romance here, only the clear, cold logic of the mountains. I miss your snuff.\n\nYour G.W.F."}}],"created":1795219100,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":202,"prompt_tokens":1125,"total_tokens":1327,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-dfcjkN64dnPsYsowhJ2AVvpytOQJbN4W","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1125,"prompt_ms":1076.295,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9567066666666667,"prompt_per_second":1045.2524633116384,"predicted_n":202,"predicted_ms":4765.739,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.710144278606965,"predicted_per_second":42.17604027413168}}